      "tree_id": "1e005009a3711eaf56b81c738dd53cbfb8fe7688",
      "message": "feat: implement Windows GUI and engine foundation spike\n\nStart AIK-001 through AIK-003 from the existing SQLite dependency frontier. Add an Electron/React desktop shell, typed and validated IPC, an authenticated private Python sidecar pipe, a real bounded subprocess worker, and Windows user DPAPI synthetic roundtrip.\n\nBundle a pinned Python runtime with the unsigned per-user Windows development installer. Add Windows CI to install outside the checkout, exercise the actual renderer buttons and backend, verify the runtime bundle, capture evidence, and uninstall.\n\nReject arbitrary commands, workspace changes, malformed protocol frames and secret fields; sanitize errors and handle child startup, timeout and shutdown. Fix defects found by independent review. Linux Python tests: 21 pass, 2 native Windows skips; Node IPC tests: 8 pass; renderer build and 65 ledger regressions pass. Windows and complete product integration remain unverified pending the real runner.",
